    {
      "name": "delegate_game",
      "docs": [
        "Base layer. Hands the game account to the delegation program so every",
        "subsequent turn runs on the ephemeral rollup.",
        "",
        "`validator` normally stays `None`, which lets the router pick whichever",
        "rollup is closest. Pin it to a specific validator identity when you need",
        "a particular one — most often right after a program upgrade, because a",
        "validator that already cloned the previous build keeps executing it. The",
        "account can only be written on the rollup that holds it, so this is the",
        "only place that choice can be made."
      ],
